Smart Supply Chain MIS Dashboard

Project Overview

An Excel-based Supply Chain Management Information System designed to monitor and analyze supply chain operations using dashboards, automated KPI calculations, and MIS reports.

Workbook Contents

* Executive Summary Dashboard
* Inventory Dashboard
* Order Management Dashboard
* Supplier Performance Dashboard
* Product Performance Dashboard
* Order Tracking
* Inventory Management
* Supplier Database
* Product Master
* Purchase Management
* Daily MIS Report
* Weekly & Monthly MIS Reports

Key Features

* Order and purchase order tracking
* Inventory and stock monitoring
* Supplier performance analysis
* Product performance reporting
* KPI calculations and lookup formulas
* Charts and conditional formatting
* Data validation
* Daily, weekly, and monthly MIS reporting

Tools & Technologies

* Microsoft Excel
* Excel Formulas and Lookup Functions
* Data Analysis
* Dashboard Design
* Supply Chain Analytics

Dataset

The workbook uses fictional sample business data for demonstration and portfolio purposes.

How to Use

1. Open SmartSupply_Chain_MIS_Dashboard.xlsx in Microsoft Excel.
2. Explore the dashboard worksheets.
3. Review the data in the respective worksheets.
4. Update sample records to explore the reports.
5. Allow Excel to recalculate formulas when prompted.

Project Objective

This project demonstrates practical Excel skills for MIS Executive, MIS Analyst, Operations Executive, and Data Management roles.
